<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="6afb394">As the risks are identified and marked in the to-be business process flows, begin documenting existing or new controls that
can be assigned to mitigate those risks in a risk and controls matrix (RACM) artifact. Capture any automated controls, IT
dependent manual (ITDM) controls or manual controls that may be needed. Support the client in determining key vs. non-key
controls, control frequency and control owners.</attribute>
